    "summary": "- Every route that takes an ID or value (path, body or query) only finds the caller's organization's objects. Another organization's ID gets 404 `{\"error\":\"not_found\"}` with the same body an unknown ID gets. This covers the five leaks found in the audit: invoice lines, webhook endpoint delete, `customer_id` on invoices and subscriptions, and the email lookup.\n- Each leak has a regression test that fails on the old code and passes now.\n- `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` pass. Existing exported names and signatures are unchanged; I only added new ones.",
